| Mode | When it runs | Input type |
|------|-------------|------------|
| `after` (default) | After Pydantic's validation | Already validated type |
| `before` | Before Pydantic's validation | Raw input (`Any`) |
| `wrap` | Around Pydantic's validation | Raw input + handler |
| `plain` | Replaces Pydantic's validation | Raw input |

